==Battleground==
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 0.33~1.33 seconds<sup>10f~40f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**10 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While no [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark Cats]] are necessary, simply using [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] is enough to irreversibly destroy this stage. [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] works in place of Bombercat with enough stacking. This stage has almost all the same enemies as [[Refined Palate (Insane)|XP Megablitz]] so if you're experienced with that stage this shouldn't be too much trouble.

Otherwise, bring a Rich Cat, three meatshields and a lot of generalist attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], etc.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] tend to perform exceptionally here.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]], [[Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Twinstars]], [[Adventurer Kanna (Uber Rare Cat)|Adventurer Kanna]], and other high-DPS Ubers trivialize this stage.

